{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "root",
    "match_status",
    "family_id",
    "match_reason"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "root": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Scope"
    },
    "match_status": {
      "enum": [
        "matched",
        "unmatched"
      ]
    },
    "family_id": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "match_reason": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 4096
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "Scope": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "整题及分问树。父条件向下继承，兄弟局部条件不互通；空数组可以省略，无需标识对象ID。",
      "properties": {
        "label": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 4096
        },
        "definitions": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 4096,
            "description": "函数/曲线/对象定义；也可保留题内新概念原文，但每问仍展开为数学关系。可写‘A、B为定点；C为动点；D为平面内一点。’，无需额外补动点标签。"
          },
          "maxItems": 128,
          "description": "定义列表，可省略。"
        },
        "facts": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 4096,
            "description": "用数学字符串表达题设，不输出专用fact对象或运算树。\n曲线定义 Γ: y = a*x^2+b*x+c；函数 f(x) = x^2；点 A = (-2,0)。\nAB表示单字母点名的无向长度，复杂点名用length(A1,B1)；∠BAC表示顶点A处非定向内角，45°为角度；area(△ABC)表示无向面积。\nP ∈ Γ；Γ ∩ x_axis = {A,B}；x(P)、y(P)取坐标；x_axis/y_axis/axis(Γ)/vertex(Γ)分别表示坐标轴、对称轴、顶点。\nsegment(A,B)/line(A,B)/ray(A,B)分别是线段/直线/以A为端点经过B的射线，不能混淆范围。\nF = midpoint(D,N)：F是DN中点；D = C+(2,0)：平移。\nsquare(A,E,K,G)/parallelogram(A,B,C,D)/quadrilateral(A,B,C,D)：按所列顶点顺序构图。\nbisects(BD,AC)：BD所在直线经过AC中点，不额外要求交点在BD内部。\ncut_ratio(BD,AC)：设两直线交点为X，表示BX/XD；第一参数端点顺序决定分子分母。X仅为解释，不要求新起点名，不默认交点在线段内部。若交点已命名O可直接写BO/OD。\n∧为同时成立，∨为至少一项成立，括号保留逻辑范围。未指定长短方向时保留ratio=k ∨ ratio=1/k；不推导排除定义分支。\n∀x∈ℝ: f(x) ≥ g(x)；∃t∈[0,2]: f(t) ≤ 1。保留量词、开闭区间和绑定变量，无需代入展开函数。\nmin_{P,Q}(AP+PQ)或min(AP+PQ)：最值下标可选；题面明确时建议填写，也可省略，不推断依赖或列固定参数。max同理。\n只支持精确数、参数、+-*/^、sqrt等受控算式。不补写默认实数域或隐含非零约束。"
          },
          "maxItems": 128,
          "description": "各项同时成立；不要写求解结果。"
        },
        "goals": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "kind",
                  "expression"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "const": "find_value"
                  },
                  "expression": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096
                  },
                  "in_terms_of": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 4096
                    },
                    "maxItems": 128,
                    "description": "可选提示；variables可省略，in_terms_of保留题面要求的表示参数。"
                  },
                  "at": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096,
                    "description": "只表达题面明确的‘此时’状态，例如AP=min(AP)，不推断最优条件。"
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "kind",
                  "object"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "const": "find_coordinates"
                  },
                  "object": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096
                  },
                  "at": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096,
                    "description": "只表达题面明确的‘此时’状态，例如AP=min(AP)，不推断最优条件。"
                  },
                  "in_terms_of": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 4096
                    },
                    "maxItems": 128,
                    "description": "可选提示；variables可省略，in_terms_of保留题面要求的表示参数。"
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "kind",
                  "object"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "const": "find_equation"
                  },
                  "object": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096
                  },
                  "at": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096,
                    "description": "只表达题面明确的‘此时’状态，例如AP=min(AP)，不推断最优条件。"
                  },
                  "in_terms_of": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 4096
                    },
                    "maxItems": 128,
                    "description": "可选提示；variables可省略，in_terms_of保留题面要求的表示参数。"
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "kind",
                  "expression"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "const": "find_minimum"
                  },
                  "expression": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096
                  },
                  "variables": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 4096
                    },
                    "maxItems": 128,
                    "description": "可选提示；variables可省略，in_terms_of保留题面要求的表示参数。"
                  },
                  "in_terms_of": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 4096
                    },
                    "maxItems": 128,
                    "description": "可选提示；variables可省略，in_terms_of保留题面要求的表示参数。"
                  },
                  "at": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096,
                    "description": "只表达题面明确的‘此时’状态，例如AP=min(AP)，不推断最优条件。"
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "kind",
                  "expression"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "const": "find_maximum"
                  },
                  "expression": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096
                  },
                  "variables": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 4096
                    },
                    "maxItems": 128,
                    "description": "可选提示；variables可省略，in_terms_of保留题面要求的表示参数。"
                  },
                  "in_terms_of": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 4096
                    },
                    "maxItems": 128,
                    "description": "可选提示；variables可省略，in_terms_of保留题面要求的表示参数。"
                  },
                  "at": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096,
                    "description": "只表达题面明确的‘此时’状态，例如AP=min(AP)，不推断最优条件。"
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "kind",
                  "symbol"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "const": "find_range"
                  },
                  "symbol": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096
                  },
                  "in_terms_of": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 4096
                    },
                    "maxItems": 128,
                    "description": "可选提示；variables可省略，in_terms_of保留题面要求的表示参数。"
                  },
                  "at": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 4096,
                    "description": "只表达题面明确的‘此时’状态，例如AP=min(AP)，不推断最优条件。"
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 128,
          "description": "保留所求类别；variables可省略，不返回答案。"
        },
        "children": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Scope"
          },
          "maxItems": 128,
          "description": "按原题分问组织；同问独立图景再分层。"
        },
        "uncertainties": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "kind",
              "text"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "kind": {
                "enum": [
                  "missing_figure",
                  "ambiguous_symbol",
                  "unreadable",
                  "occluded",
                  "unstructured",
                  "ambiguous_reuse"
                ]
              },
              "text": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 4096
              }
            }
          },
          "maxItems": 128,
          "description": "题面引用的图形未提供时记录missing_figure；不猜图、不从无图推导图中条件。"
        }
      }
    }
  }
